    "title": "GoFan: Buy Tickets to Events",
    "description": "Discover and experience your favorite school events with GoFan, the leader in digital ticketing for high school athletics, performing arts, dances, camps, and more.\r\n\r\nBUY TICKETS TO SCHOOL EVENTS\r\nSearch for your school to see upcoming events and get tickets.\r\n\r\nUSE TICKETS WITH YOUR PHONE\r\nAccess tickets from the app and present them on your mobile device to enter events.\r\n\r\nSHARE TICKETS WITH FRIENDS & FAMILY\r\nEasily transfer tickets to friends or family with a text or email.\r\n\r\nACCESS EVENTS ALL YEAR\r\nFavorite your school to stay connected and find events faster.",
